==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crazed Yuki (Enemy)|Crazed Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
