**1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
**4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level includes mostly Angel enemies, which can be beaten with high damage units or any anti-Angel CC. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] for example is very useful here due to his Resistance ability. Yuki poses no danger once her support is taken care of, so whittle them down with units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] for the win.

